      "excerpt": "ClimateLaunchpad Facebook – Instagram – LinkedIn – YouTube About the competition Back Competition info Apply now Trainers FAQ About Us Participating countries Back Participating countries Become a national organiser Partners Back Our partner network Partner up Blog Join the world’s largest green business ideas competition Turn your green idea into a successful start-up 540 Boot camps delivered 5K Ideas incubated 500M Euros Raised by alumni 51 Participating countries in 2026 Get ready Have an idea for a greener future? This is your place to start. Explore Test your idea safely Have a green idea but not sure where to start? ClimateLaunchpad is a free space to explore, test, and shape your concept with expert guidance. Learn Learn by doing Gain practical tools to shape your idea into a real solution. Join boot camps, coaching sessions, and a global community supporting your journey. Apply new skills directly to grow your idea. Meet the trainers Connect Join a global community ClimateLaunchpad brings people together with bold ideas and big ambitions. Meet fellow innovators, mentors, and experts who believe in climate solutions, and be part of something bigger. Climate-KIC network Pitch Take your idea to the stage As you progress, you’ll pitch your idea on bigger stages, gain visibility, meet global partners, and unlock new opportunities. March – May 2026 Applications Now Open To"
