      "page": "terms",
      "excerpt": "ClimateLaunchpad – Frequently asked questions Facebook – Instagram – LinkedIn – YouTube About the competition Back Competition info Apply now Trainers FAQ About Us Participating countries Back Participating countries Become a national organiser Partners Back Our partner network Partner up Blog Competition Frequently asked questions What is ClimateLaunchpad? ClimateLaunchpad is the world’s largest green business ideas competition. Innovation and invention can lead the way to a clean future. Through ClimateLaunchpad, we create a stage for the people who have great ideas for climate innovation, and help them take the first steps of entrepreneurial thinking, business planning, and a pitch around their idea – developing those ideas into start-ups and making a global impact. ClimateLaunchpad is part of the Entrepreneurship offerings of Climate KIC . Join the green wave! About Climate KIC Established in 2010, Climate KIC is Europe’s leading climate innovation agency and community, supporting cities, regions, countries and industries to meet their climate ambitions through systems innovation and place-based transformations. Together with our partners, we generate, implement and integrate climate solutions by mobilising finance, testing business models, and opening pathways for institutional change and behavioural change. We orchestrate large-scale demonstrations that show what is"
