      "page": "terms",
      "excerpt": "ClimateLaunchpad – Terms & conditions Facebook – Instagram – LinkedIn – YouTube About the competition Back Competition info Apply now Trainers FAQ About Us Participating countries Back Participating countries Become a national organiser Partners Back Our partner network Partner up Blog Terms & conditions Latest version: February 2026 1. Background and Introduction ClimateLaunchpad is an early-stage global green business ideas competition. Our mission is to unlock the world’s cleantech potential by supporting very early-stage start-ups that address climate change and help shape the world’s next economy (the “Competition”). The Competition is run primarily via climatelaunchpad.org (the “Competition Website”). The Competition is organised by Stichting Climate-KIC International Foundation (“Climate KIC”), in collaboration with National Leads and partner organisations worldwide (“Partners”). References to “we”, “us” and “our” refer to Climate KIC and its Partners. Stichting Climate-KIC International Foundation (RSIN 860987541) is registered with the Dutch Chamber of Commerce under number 77373154. Its registered office is Plantage Middenlaan 45, 1018 DC, Amsterdam, The Netherlands. By submitting an entry through the Competition Website, you accept and agree to comply with these Terms and Conditions. The name ClimateLaunchpad is a registered trademark owned by Climate KIC. 2."
